# Phase WN1 -- the why-not explanation kernel

## 1. Status

**Draft r1, blocked.** Implementable once the owner approves plan r1 and rules
WN-D2, WN-D3, WN-D4, WN-D6, WN-D7 and WN-D9 (plan §10), which change the
algorithm, the module path and the payload fields below. No implementation has
started.

